<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Boutique - Urgence Lilloise</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0a0a0c;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .icon-box {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      color: #e52d48;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    p {
      color: #a0a0a0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .btn-back {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background-color: #121218;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-back:hover {
      background-color: #1a1a22;
      border-color: #e52d48;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.7; }
      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="icon-box">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
  </div>
  
  <h1>Boutique Bientôt Disponible</h1>
  <p>Cette page n'est pas disponible pour le moment. Quelque chose de grand se prépare dans l'ombre... Restez à l'affût.</p>
  
  <a href="/" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Retour à l'accueil</a>

</body>
</html>
